IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P6-art-51-52`
IMPORT `P6-art-55-56`

-- P6-tests-art-55-56: tests of Articles 55 and 56, written from the text (work/gen_55_56_tests.py decides each expected value from the text, not from the encoding).
-- Chapter V applies from 2 August 2025; Art 111(3): the provider of a model placed on the market before 2 August 2025 has until 2 August 2027.
-- The Omnibus enters into force on 27 July 2026: Article 56(6) is tested on each side of it.
-- The argument order of each function is stated above its group of assertions: two BOOLEAN or two DATE arguments swapped would still type-check.

§ `Dates and models used in the tests`

`Art 55 test the day before the group applies` MEANS Date 1 8 2025
`Art 55 test a later day` MEANS Date 1 3 2026
`Art 55 test the day before the Omnibus` MEANS Date 26 7 2026
`Art 55 test the first day of the Omnibus` MEANS Date 27 7 2026
`Art 55 test the day before the legacy time ends` MEANS Date 1 8 2027
`Art 55 test the first day of the legacy time` MEANS Date 2 8 2027

-- A model placed on the market on 3 August 2025, after the group begins to apply.
`Art 55 test model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

-- A model placed on the market on 1 August 2025: Art 111(3) gives its provider until 2 August 2027.
`Art 55 test legacy model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 1 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

§ `Article 55: the gate of a provider of a model with systemic risk`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, general-purpose AI model with systemic risk
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "providers of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk"
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test the day before the group applies` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(3)
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test the day before the legacy time ends` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55 the obligations of the provider of a model with systemic risk are owed on the date asked` `Art 55 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
§ `Article 55(1), point (a): model evaluation`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, with systemic risk
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the provider must perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the provider must perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the provider must perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test the day before the group applies` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the provider must perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, with systemic risk, performed model evaluation, in accordance with standardised protocols and tools reflecting the state of the art, conducted adversarial testing, documented it, with a view to identifying and mitigating systemic risks
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(a) the model evaluation is what the point requires` `Art 55 test the day before the group applies` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(a) the provider's duty to perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 55(1)(a) perform model evaluation in accordance with standardised protocols and tools reflecting the state of the art` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(a) the provider's duty to perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(a) the provider's duty to perform model evaluation` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
§ `Article 55(1), point (b): assessing and mitigating systemic risks`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, with systemic risk
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the provider must assess and mitigate possible systemic risks at Union level` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the provider must assess and mitigate possible systemic risks at Union level` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the provider must assess and mitigate possible systemic risks at Union level` `Art 55 test the day before the group applies` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
