#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the assessment and mitigation of the systemic risks are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the assessment and mitigation of the systemic risks are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the assessment and mitigation of the systemic risks are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the assessment and mitigation of the systemic risks are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(b) the assessment and mitigation of the systemic risks are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(b) the provider's duty to assess and mitigate possible systemic risks` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 55(1)(b) assess and mitigate possible systemic risks at Union level` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(b) the provider's duty to assess and mitigate possible systemic risks` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
