    WAITUNTIL 400
§ `Article 55(1), point (c): serious incidents`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, with systemic risk, there has been a serious incident
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no serious incident: the duty has no object
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test the day before the group applies` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the provider must keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` `Art 55 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 55 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, with systemic risk, serious incident, tracks and documents, reported to the AI Office, without undue delay, reporting to the national competent authorities is appropriate, reported to them
-- reporting to the national authorities is not appropriate: not required
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "as appropriate": appropriate and not done
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no serious incident
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(c) the tracking, documenting and reporting are what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(c) the provider's duty to keep track of, document and report serious incidents` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 55(1)(c) keep track of, document, and report relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(c) the provider's duty to keep track of, document and report serious incidents` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 55(1)(c) the provider's duty to keep track of, document and report serious incidents` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
