#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(d) the cybersecurity protection is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 55(1)(d) the cybersecurity protection is what the point requires` `Art 55 test a later day` `Art 55 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
